Some one-click service templates are adapted from the two projects below.
The rest of LogiStack does not include code from Coolify or Dokploy.

The template catalog (packages/templates/catalog) is generated by
packages/templates/scripts/convert.ts. Templates were translated into
LogiStack's own schema; compose files, variable conventions and metadata were
adapted, not copied verbatim. Each catalog file records its origin in
`source.kind`, `source.path` and `source.license`.

Logos in packages/templates/catalog/logos are copied from those repositories
and remain the trademarks of their respective projects; they are shown only to
identify each project.

